      "message": "Because values must be identical to userspace libselinux. These enums have already been added to [`external/selinux`](https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:external/selinux/libsepol/include/sepol/policydb/polcaps.h;l\u003d9;drc\u003da1788ed503c2e7b86a333e9ac5cede9bc6abd6aa), so we need these extra enums to make them identical, even when we only take care of `GENFS_SECLABEL_WILDCARD`.\n\n@takayas@google.com Do we need to fully cherry-pick changes introducing these enums?",
